{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/1/511cb5c011949bb3ef9b553161d820399622f190.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{a^2+x^2}-\\frac{x^2-a^2}{\\sqrt{a^2+x^2}}}{a^2+x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"149\" height=\"48\" /> reduces to: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/245c700adc986a30ce81039623401702fc7aa153.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{2a^2}{a^2+x^2} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{2x^2}{(a^2+x^2)^{\\frac{3}{2}}}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{2a^2}{(a^2+x^2)^{\\frac{3}{2}}}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{2x^2}{a^2+x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"605\" height=\"44\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying the numerator and denominator by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/f/aafce9821ea97989b94ce5a74707aa0fd01df809.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a^2+x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"21\" /> results in \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/a/80a89547c020322569b55b86e1c06a5abce29581.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a^2+x^2-x^2+a^2}{(a^2+x^2)(\\sqrt{a^2+x^2)}}=\\frac{2a^2}{(a^2+x^2)(\\sqrt{a^2+x^2)}}.\\]\" width=\"354\" height=\"47\" /> \nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/e/ace8a7e252615c8e1284c596e2f2ad98703b372e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a^2+x^2}=(a^2+x^2)^{\\frac{1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"180\" height=\"24\" />, \nthe denominator is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/0/de0c60f40b18920298c6b8d5094c08b01df3d327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^2+x^2)^2\\cdot (a^2+x^2)^{\\frac{1}{2}} = (a^2+x^2)^{\\frac{3}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"277\" height=\"22\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/e/c6e9a5af3e3e6df450faf4372d605970e50db352.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } \\frac{2a^2}{(a^2+x^2)^{\\frac{3}{2}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -24px\" width=\"133\" height=\"56\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td wid